notes = "(!) BS-X.bin (md5): fed4d8242cfbed61343d53d48432aced|(!) STBIOS.bin (md5): d3a44ba7d42a74d3ac58cb9c14c6a5ca|(!) Super Game Boy BIOS (sgb.sfc / sgb2.sfc) is optional: without it, GB/GBC content runs on the built-in BIOS-less core. Place it in the system directory.|(!) DSP-1/1B/2/3/4 and Cx4 dumps (dsp1.bin, dsp1b.bin, dsp2.bin, dsp3.bin, dsp4.bin, cx4.bin, or their No-Intro .zip) are optional: the chips run natively without them. A chip runs its dump only when its core option is set to Firmware.|(!) Game Boy Color content runs in monochrome DMG-compatibility mode (no color hardware emulation)."

